# `t.await(captureContext = false)` — the CONFIGURED arm, reached as an ordinary expression rather than through an
# arm of its own (GitHub #64). The constant is passed to `ConfigureAwait` as the value it is, which is what makes
# the dynamic case a generalization of this one instead of a second path beside it: a `false` beside a
# synthesized-literal arm would be indistinguishable at run time, so the shape is the only witness.
+"method":"ConfigureAwait"
+"args":[{"k":"const","type":{"t":"fqn","name":"System.Boolean"},"value":false}]
+"method":"GetAwaiter"
+ConfiguredTaskAwaitable
